<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Performance Materials</title>
<style>
    body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #fff;
        color: #000;
    }
    .slide {
        width: 1024px;
        height: 768px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        position: relative;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header {
        height: 50px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, #d31245 88%, #8a8d91 88%);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        align-items: center;
        padding-right: 20px;
    }
    .logo {
        width: 90px;
        height: 40px;
        background-color: #d31245;
        border-radius: 50%;
        border: 2px solid white;
        color: white;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .title-container {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 15px;
    }
    .main-title {
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .sub-title {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-style: italic;
        margin: 5px 0 25px 0;
        font-weight: normal;
    }
    .content {
        display: flex;
        padding: 0 40px;
        gap: 40px;
    }
    .col-left {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 25px;
    }
    .col-right {
        flex: 1.15;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 25px;
    }

    /* Chart Styles */
    .chart-box {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .chart-header {
        background-color: #2b5d9c;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 6px 0;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .chart-body {
        display: flex;
        align-items: stretch;
    }
    .y-axis-label {
        writing-mode: vertical-rl;
        transform: rotate(180deg);
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .y-axis-label-right {
        writing-mode: vertical-rl;
        transform: rotate(180deg);
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .y-axis-values {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: right;
        padding: 0 8px;
    }
    .y-axis-values-right {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-align: left;
        padding: 0 8px;
    }
    .graph-area {
        flex-grow: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }
    .placeholder {
        flex-grow: 1;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        border: 1px dashed #aaa;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        color: #555;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 10px;
    }
    .x-axis-values {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-around;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: bold;
        padding-top: 8px;
    }

    /* Specific Chart Adjustments */
    .chart1-body { height: 180px; }
    .chart2-body { height: 220px; }
    .chart1-graph { border-left: 1px solid #000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
    .chart2-graph { border-left: 1px solid #000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; border-right: 1px solid #000; }

    .legend-left {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        padding-bottom: 25px;
        padding-right: 5px;
    }
    .legend-blue-square {
        width: 14px;
        height: 14px;
        background-color: #2b5d9c;
    }
    .legend-right {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .legend-red-line {
        width: 2px;
        height: 20px;
        background-color: #d31245;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    /* Text Box Styles */
    .text-box {
        background-color: #f2f2f2;
        border-radius: 15px;
        padding: 15px 25px 20px 25px;
        box-shadow: 2px 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }
    .text-box-title {
        text-align: center;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .text-box ul {
        list-style-type: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .text-box li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .text-box li:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .text-box li::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        top: 3px;
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #333;
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #fff, #ddd);
        box-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    /* Footer Styles */
    .footer {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 15px;
        left: 40px;
        right: 40px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .footnotes {
        font-size: 11px;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .footnotes div {
        margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .page-number {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="slide">
    <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">OU PONT</div>
    </div>

    <div class="title-container">
        <h1 class="main-title">Performance Materials***</h1>
        <h2 class="sub-title">Performance Polymers (DPP), Packaging & Industrial Polymers (P&IP)</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <div class="col-left">
            <!-- Chart 1 -->
            <div class="chart-box">
                <div class="chart-header">2Q Sales *</div>
                <div class="chart-body chart1-body">
                    <div class="y-axis-label">$ in Billions</div>
                    <div class="y-axis-values">
                        <span>2.0</span><span>1.6</span><span>1.2</span><span>0.8</span><span>0.4</span><span>0.0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="graph-area">
                        <div class="placeholder chart1-graph">
                            [Bar Chart: 3 blue bars representing sales for 2Q12, 2Q13, 2Q14. All bars are approximately at the 1.6 level.]
                        </div>
                        <div class="x-axis-values">
                            <span>2Q12</span><span>2Q13</span><span>2Q14</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Chart 2 -->
            <div class="chart-box">
                <div class="chart-header">2Q Operating Earnings **</div>
                <div class="chart-body chart2-body">
                    <div class="legend-left">
                        <div class="legend-blue-square"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="y-axis-label">$ in Millions</div>
                    <div class="y-axis-values">
                        <span>375</span><span>300</span><span>225</span><span>150</span><span>75</span><span>0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="graph-area">
                        <div class="placeholder chart2-graph">
                            [Combo Chart: Blue bars for Operating Earnings (left axis), Red line for Margin (right axis).<br>
                            2Q12: Bar ~320, Line ~20%<br>
                            2Q13: Bar ~330, Line ~21%<br>
                            2Q14: Bar ~305, Line ~19%]
                        </div>
                        <div class="x-axis-values">
                            <span>2Q12</span><span>2Q13</span><span>2Q14</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="y-axis-values-right">
                        <span>25%</span><span>20%</span><span>15%</span><span>10%</span><span>5%</span><span>0%</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="legend-right">
                        <div class="y-axis-label-right">Margin</div>
                        <div class="legend-red-line"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-right">
            <!-- Text Box 1 -->
            <div class="text-box">
                <div class="text-box-title">2Q Comments</div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Sales down 2% due to lower volumes resulting from the scheduled ethylene outage and portfolio impact of the GLS/Vinyls sale</li>
                    <li>Demand for Performance Polymers up mid-single digits due to strengthening automotive market</li>
                    <li>Demand environment in consumer, construction, and food packaging markets remains stable</li>
                    <li>Operating earnings down 9% as higher sales in automotive were more than offset by reduced supply of ethylene and the portfolio impact of the GLS/Vinyls sale</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Text Box 2 -->
            <div class="text-box">
                <div class="text-box-title">3Q Outlook</div>
                <ul>
                    <li>3Q sales essentially flat due to the GLS/Vinyls sale</li>
                    <li>Consumer, construction, and food packaging volumes forecasted to remain stable</li>
                    <li>Automotive volumes anticipated to remain strong led by China and Europe</li>
                    <li>3Q operating earnings up modestly versus prior year which included a $30 million benefit related to a JV equity position</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <div class="footnotes">
            <div>* Segment sales include transfers.</div>
            <div>** See appendix for reconciliation of non-GAAP measures.</div>
            <div>*** Prior periods reflect reclassification of Viton® fluoroelastomers from Performance Materials to Performance Chemicals</div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-number">13</div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
```
